  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"Aziz\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nHayat\u0131na
    dair \u0130yi ya da k\xF6t\xFC oldu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCn
    her ne varsa, bir noktada hepsini kucaklam\u0131\u015F, ba\u015F\u0131na gelen
    t\xFCm olaylar\u0131 kabullenmi\u015Fsin. Sana verilenlere memnun olmakla birlikte,
    senden al\u0131nanlara da raz\u0131 olmu\u015F, her \u015Feyde senin hayr\u0131na
    bir sebep oldu\u011Funu kendine s\xFCrekli hat\u0131rlatm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n
    {{isim}}. Ya\u015Fam\u0131n dalgal\u0131 ve co\u015Fkun nehirlerine kar\u015F\u0131
    direnmedi\u011Finde, evren seni o dalgalarla birlikte nice yeni mutluluklara
    ta\u015F\u0131m\u0131\u015F. B\xF6ylelikle raz\u0131 geli\u015Fteki, vazge\xE7i\u015Fteki
    ve her t\xFCrl\xFC ak\u0131beti kucaklay\u0131\u015Ftaki \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFC\u011F\xFC
    ke\u015Ffetmi\u015Fsin."
